session:pr432Summary a agp:TranscriptSummary ;
    agp:summaryText "The backlog_endpoint crate (#381 Stage 1 restructuring: the dashboard split out of sparql_endpoint into its own process/binary) had no crate-level README -- only scattered doc comments in main.rs/lib.rs and scripts/serve-backlog.sh's own header comment explained how to actually run it, what flags it took, or what was on each dashboard tab. Not tied to a specific filed issue -- a direct documentation request during ongoing work on the dashboard epic (#378). Added backlog_endpoint/README.md (quickstart via scripts/serve-backlog.sh, running the two processes by hand with a --port/--sparql-endpoint flag table, a summary of the four dashboard tabs, how to refresh the snapshot, and how to run the crate's tests) and linked it from a new \"Backlog dashboard\" section in the top-level README.md, between \"Web UI\" and \"License\", so it's discoverable from the repo's front door rather than only findable by already knowing the crate exists." ;
    agp:reasoningFor ghpull:432 ;
    prov:wasGeneratedBy session:pr432 ;
    prov:wasAttributedTo session:claudeSonnet5 .
